      "page": "model",
      "label": "model-figure-2",
      "source_block_id": "40025656-1ff8-8056-8d49-f36bf4a86908",
      "caption": "Figure 2. The inputs of the model. UCI-270 (6 gases, 128 features per measurement) and DoOR (published responses of the 10 fly olfactory receptors that our wet lab expresses, one 10-value vector per odorant) are each standardized, reduced with linear PCA and passed through the PN→KC→MBON network; the most active MBON is the predicted class. The wet lab’s OR cell lines (dashed) are the planned input: their first plate does not yet match DoOR (Section 3.4), so the results on this page do not use them. Italic labels under the inputs give the sections that use them; under the network, the fly counterpart of each stage.",
